{"ts": "2026-09-13T06:41:41.773954+00:00", "event": "git_guard_blocked", "state_version": "v11", "wf": null, "phase": "unknown", "task_id": null, "agent": "unknown", "decision": "deny", "reason": "git push \u2014 pushing to remote. Use a branch and PR instead.", "command": "cat >> /root/Shepherd/docs/plans/2026-09-13-m1-foundation-visibility-plan.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Functionality Flows (each step and error path maps to a test)\n\n```\nFlow A \u2014 a hand-launched session appears on the fleet page\n1. user runs `claude` in /work/acme/api (hooks installed) \u2192 Claude Code runs hookd with the SessionStart payload\n   \u2192 test: test_hookd.py::test_sends_enveloped_frame\n2. hookd builds the envelope and writes a HOOK_EVENT frame to sessiond-hook.sock within 250 ms, exits 0, no output\n   \u2192 test: test_hookd.py::test_exit_zero_matrix\n3. sessiond validates magic, version, token and length, then enqueues\n   \u2192 test: test_frames.py::test_decode_header_rejections, test_sessiond.py::test_hook_socket_rejects_bad_token\n4. the writer parses tolerantly and registers the attached session, binding cwd by longest prefix\n   \u2192 test: test_events.py::test_parse_total, test_binding.py::test_innermost_repo_wins, test_store_sessions.py::test_register_idempotent\n5. fold \u2192 state running, last_event_at \u2192 store patch \u2192 SESSION_CHANGED frame to controld\n   \u2192 test: test_fold.py::test_session_start_running, test_sessiond.py::test_change_pushed_to_control\n6. controld publishes session.registered with a card; SSE clients receive it\n   \u2192 test: test_events_hub.py::test_publish_order, test_e2e_scripted.py::test_hook_to_sse\n7. the fleet page inserts the card at its rank\n   \u2192 manual: T18 checklist item L7; test: test_ordering.py::test_session_order_key\nError paths:\n- sessiond down / socket missing \u2192 hookd exit 0 in < 300 ms wall \u2192 test_hookd.py::test_socket_absent\n- sessiond hung (accepts, never reads) \u2192 hookd deadline \u2192 test_hookd.py::test_blocked_socket_deadline\n- malformed / non-JSON payload \u2192 counted `malformed`, no row \u2192 test_events.py::test_malformed_counts\n- cwd matches no repo \u2192 bound to wsp_unassigned and shown \u2192 test_binding.py::test_unassigned_fallback\n- sessiond not yet schema-gated \u2192 events buffered (bounded), folded after SCHEMA_READY \u2192 test_sessiond.py::test_gate_buffers_then_drains\n- queue full \u2192 dropped_backpressure counted \u2192 test_sessiond.py::test_backpressure_counts\n\nFlow B \u2014 a permission prompt surfaces as needs_you\n1. PermissionRequest{tool_name: Bash, tool_input.command} \u2192 state needs_you, reason \"permission: Bash(git push)\"\n   \u2192 test: test_fold.py::test_permission_request_raises\n2. controld publishes needs_you.raised and session.state_changed \u2192 test: test_e2e_scripted.py::test_needs_you_roundtrip\n3. user approves \u2192 PostToolUse(Bash) \u2192 running, reason cleared \u2192 test: test_fold.py::test_matching_posttool_clears\nError paths:\n- user denies \u2192 Stop \u2192 stopped, reason cleared \u2192 test_fold.py::test_stop_clears_needs_you\n- tool_name absent \u2192 \"permission: (unknown tool)\" \u2192 test_fold.py::test_permission_reason_absent_fields\n- PostToolUse for a different tool while pending \u2192 stays needs_you \u2192 test_fold.py::test_nonmatching_posttool_keeps\n\nFlow C \u2014 expand a session's subagents\n1. SubagentStart/Stop \u2192 active_subagents \u00b1 1 (clamped at \u22650) \u2192 test: test_fold.py::test_subagent_counts_clamp\n2. UI GET /api/sessions/{id}/subagents \u2192 engine.list_subagents reads meta.json + parent transcript\n   \u2192 test: test_transcript.py::test_list_subagents_states, test_http_api.py::test_subagents_projection\nError paths:\n- transcript missing \u2192 [] plus 404-free empty list \u2192 test_transcript.py::test_missing_transcript_empty\n- malformed trailing line \u2192 skipped and counted \u2192 test_jsonl.py::test_skips_malformed_trailing_line\n\nFlow D \u2014 browser reconnects after a gap\n1. EventSource reconnects with Last-Event-ID k \u2192 events k+1..current replayed in order\n   \u2192 test: test_events_hub.py::test_gap_replay_exact, test_sse_http.py::test_last_event_id_header_replay\n2. k outside ring, or from before a controld restart \u2192 single `resync` \u2192 client refetches /api/fleet\n   \u2192 test: test_events_hub.py::test_resync_outside_ring, test_events_hub.py::test_seq_monotonic_across_restart\n\nFlow E \u2014 register a workspace and its repos\n1. `shepherd workspace add acme --root /work/acme` \u2192 POST /api/workspaces \u2192 rebinding of repo-less sessions under the root\n   \u2192 test: test_store_workspaces.py::test_create_workspace_rebinds_unassigned\n2. `shepherd discover /work/acme --workspace acme --add` \u2192 candidates \u2192 POST /api/repos per candidate\n   \u2192 test: test_discovery.py::test_finds_nested_git_dirs, test_cli.py::test_discover_add_posts\nError paths:\n- path already registered to another workspace \u2192 409 with a generic message \u2192 test_http_api.py::test_repo_conflict_409\n- cross-origin POST \u2192 403 \u2192 test_http_security.py::test_origin_rejected\n- symlink loop in discovery \u2192 not followed \u2192 test_discovery.py::test_does_not_follow_symlinks\n\nFlow F \u2014 start or upgrade with an incompatible database\n1. controld start \u2192 apply_migrations in one transaction \u2192 test: test_migrate.py::test_fresh_apply\n2. applied checksum differs \u2192 exit 78, no writes \u2192 test: test_migrate.py::test_checksum_mismatch_refuses\n3. DB version > bundled \u2192 exit 78 \u2192 test: test_migrate.py::test_db_newer_refuses\n4. sessiond with a mismatched SCHEMA_READY \u2192 stays gated, never migrates \u2192 test: test_sessiond.py::test_schema_mismatch_stays_gated\n```\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Container view (M1)\n\n```\nbrowser \u2500\u2500HTTP/SSE (127.0.0.1:<http_port>)\u2500\u2500\u25ba controld \u2500\u2500UDS sessiond-control.sock (frames)\u2500\u2500\u25ba sessiond\n                                                 \u2502                                              \u25b2\n                                                 \u2502 store/ (SQLite WAL, one file)                \u2502 UDS sessiond-hook.sock\n                                                 \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 shepherd.db \u25c4\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524 (HOOK_EVENT frames)\n                                                                                                \u2502\n                                        claude (attached) \u2500\u2500hook stdin\u2500\u2500\u25ba hookd.py \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518\n                                        claude transcripts (~/.claude/projects) \u25c4\u2500\u2500 read-only by engine/claude_code\n```\n\n| Container | Responsibility | Writes | Restart semantics |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hookd.py` | Forward one hook payload; never harm Claude | nothing | per event, ~30 ms |\n| `sessiond` | Ingest, fold, liveness sweep, transcript title/model refresh | `session` live and title columns | long-lived. Loses in-memory fold memory (pending permission, stop prompt id, pid map, transcript offsets), all recoverable. |\n| `controld` | Migrate, serve API/SSE/UI, registration | `workspace`, `repo`, rebind columns, `app_state` | restartable freely. Clients `resync`. |\n\n### Integration table\n\n| System | Protocol | Direction | Contract | Failure mode | Retry |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Claude Code hooks | command hook, JSON on stdin | they call us | \u00a7Ground Truth 1 | hookd exits 0, event lost | none (principle 4) |\n| Claude Code transcripts | JSONL files | we read | \u00a7Ground Truth 5\u20136 | missing or malformed \u2192 null columns, counted | next Stop |\n| Claude Code settings | JSON file merge | we write (CLI only) | DV-20 | invalid source JSON \u2192 refuse; backup first | manual |\n| systemd `--user` | unit files | we write files; the user enables them | T16 | not enabled \u2192 foreground `shepherd controld run` | n/a |\n\nDependency classes: Claude Code is **Wrapped** (behind `EngineAdapter`). SQLite is **Infra, wrapped by `store/`** (D26). systemd, launchd, Keychain and `/proc` are **Wrapped** (platform seam).\n\n### Module layout (component view) \u2014 files and ownership\n\n```\npyproject.toml                         T00  project, mypy strict, pytest markers (slow, live), setuptools\nscripts/bootstrap_venv.sh              T00  venv --without-pip + get-pip.py (python urllib) + pip install -e '.[dev]'\nsrc/shepherd/__init__.py               T00\nsrc/shepherd/jsontypes.py              T00  `type JsonValue = ...`\nsrc/shepherd/timeutil.py               T00  utc_now_iso, to_iso, parse_iso, iso_age_s\nsrc/shepherd/ids.py                    T00  ULID + prefix\nsrc/shepherd/exitcodes.py              T00\nsrc/shepherd/config.py                 T01  ShepherdConfig, resolve_profile, load_config, ConfigError\nsrc/shepherd/platform/__init__.py      T01  Platform, current_platform\nsrc/shepherd/platform/base.py          T01  PlatformPaths, ProcessProbe, ServiceSupervisor, ServiceSpec, ServiceStatus, socket/token names\nsrc/shepherd/platform/linux.py         T01/T16  linux_paths, LinuxProcessProbe, SystemdUserSupervisor (T16)\nsrc/shepherd/platform/macos.py         T01/T16  macos_paths, DarwinProcessProbe, LaunchdSupervisor (T16) \u2014 UNVERIFIED\nsrc/shepherd/platform/credentials.py   T02  Credentials Protocol, AuthMaterial, FileCredentials, KeychainCredentials, errors\nsrc/shepherd/domain/models.py          T03  Workspace, Repo, Session, SessionLivePatch, UNSET, Literals, SubagentInfo, ProcAncestor\nsrc/shepherd/domain/signals.py         T03  TitleSignal, PromptSignal, ModelSignal, EffortSignal, Signal\nsrc/shepherd/domain/binding.py         T03  canonical_path, is_path_prefix, bind_cwd, repo_for_path, UNASSIGNED_WORKSPACE_ID\nsrc/shepherd/domain/ordering.py        T03  session_order_key, workspace_order_key, state_label\nsrc/shepherd/store/__init__.py         T05  re-exports Store, errors\nsrc/shepherd/store/_conn.py            T04  connection factory (pragmas), thread-local\nsrc/shepherd/store/migrate.py          T04  apply_migrations, MigrationReport, refusals\nsrc/shepherd/store/schema.py           T04  SCHEMA_VERSION, read_schema_version\nsrc/shepherd/store/errors.py           T04/T05\nsrc/shepherd/store/migrations/0001_foundation.sql  T04\nsrc/shepherd/store/store.py            T05  Store class: open + workspace/repo/app_state verbs\nsrc/shepherd/store/_sessions.py        T05  session verbs (module-private helpers used by Store)\nsrc/shepherd/store/_rows.py            T05  row \u2192 dataclass converters (never exported)\nsrc/shepherd/discovery.py              T06  discover_repos, DiscoveredRepo\nsrc/shepherd/ipc/frames.py             T07  frame protocol\nsrc/shepherd/ipc/messages.py           T07  SessionChange, SessiondStatus, IngestCounters codecs\nsrc/shepherd/hookd.py                  T07  standalone dispatcher (stdlib only)\nsrc/shepherd/ingest/events.py          T08  HookEvent, HookEnvelope, parse_envelope, KNOWN_EVENTS\nsrc/shepherd/ingest/fold.py            T08  FoldMemory, FoldInput, FoldOutcome, fold_event, apply_signals, sweep_decision, permission_reason\nsrc/shepherd/jsonl.py                  T09  read_jsonl_delta\nsrc/shepherd/engine/claude_code/transcript.py     T09  project_slug, parse_signals, locate_transcript_in, list_subagents_in\nsrc/shepherd/engine/claude_code/hooks_settings.py T10  merge_hooks, strip_hooks, is_shepherd_entry, hook_command, install/uninstall IO\nsrc/shepherd/engine/base.py            T11  EngineAdapter Protocol, EngineCapabilities, HookTarget, HookInstallReport\nsrc/shepherd/engine/claude_code/adapter.py        T11  ClaudeCodeEngine\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/__init__.py       T01+\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/env.py            T01  isolated_env(), tmp_platform()\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/scripted_credentials.py      T02\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/scripted_platform.py         T01/T16  ScriptedProcessProbe, ScriptedSupervisor\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/hook_payloads.py  T08  builders mirroring observed payloads\nsrc/shepherd/testkit/scripted_engine.py T11\nsrc/shepherd/sessiond/writer.py        T12  WriterLoop\nsrc/shepherd/sessiond/ingest_service.py T12 IngestService\nsrc/shepherd/sessiond/servers.py       T12  hook + control socket servers, runtime-dir hardening\nsrc/shepherd/sessiond/main.py          T12  run_sessiond\nsrc/shepherd/logs.py                   T12  configure_daemon_logging (daily + size, gzip, retention)\nsrc/shepherd/controld/events.py        T13  EventHub, Subscription, EventEnvelope\nsrc/shepherd/controld/sessiond_link.py T13  SessiondLink, LinkStatus\nsrc/shepherd/controld/main.py          T13  run_controld\nsrc/shepherd/controld/security.py      T14  check_host, check_origin, SECURITY_HEADERS\nsrc/shepherd/controld/projections.py   T14  session_card, fleet_view, subagent_view, health_view\nsrc/shepherd/controld/http.py          T14  make_server, routes, SSE handler, static\nsrc/shepherd/web/static/index.html     T15\nsrc/shepherd/web/static/js/{app,api,sse,fleet,dom}.js  T15\nsrc/shepherd/web/static/css/app.css    T15\nsrc/shepherd/cli/__main__.py, cli/main.py, cli/http_client.py  T16\ntests/\u2026                                per task (names in each task)\ntests/fixtures/hooks/*.json            T08  sanitized copies of the probe payloads (paths rewritten to /work/\u2026)\ntests/fixtures/transcripts/\u2026           T09  sanitized transcript + subagents dir\n```\n\n### Import rules (enforced by `tests/test_repo_rules.py`, T00; rules added as packages appear)\n\n| Rule | Statement |\n|---|---|\n| R1 | `sqlite3` is imported only under `shepherd/store/` (D26). |\n| R2 | `shepherd.store.migrate` is imported only by `shepherd.store`, `shepherd.controld`, and tests. **`shepherd.sessiond` must never import it** (\u00a77 migration rule 3). |\n| R3 | `shepherd.store._conn`, `_rows`, `_sessions` are imported only inside `shepherd.store` (D33: no driver rows escape). |\n| R4 | `shepherd.sessiond` \u219b `shepherd.controld` and `shepherd.controld` \u219b `shepherd.sessiond`. They talk only through `shepherd.ipc`. |\n| R5 | `shepherd.hookd` imports only `{sys, os, json, socket, struct, time}` and nothing from `shepherd`. |\n| R6 | Pure modules (`shepherd.domain.*`, `shepherd.ingest.*`, `shepherd.ipc.frames`, `shepherd.ipc.messages`, `shepherd.engine.base`) import none of `{socket, sqlite3, http, subprocess, threading, urllib}` and none of `shepherd.{store, controld, sessiond, cli}`. |\n| R7 | `shepherd.engine` \u219b `shepherd.store`. |\n| R8 | Production modules (not `shepherd.testkit`, not tests) \u219b `shepherd.testkit`. |\n| R9 | If `shepherd/master/` exists, it imports only `shepherd.toolsurface.client`, `claude_agent_sdk`, and stdlib (D19). Vacuous in M1. |\n| R10 | No `shell=True`, `os.system`, `os.popen`, `subprocess.getoutput`, `subprocess.getstatusoutput` (\u00a713). |\n| R11 | No `Any` imported from `typing` and no bare `Any` annotations (principle 6; mypy `disallow_any_explicit` too). |\n| R12 | No `.py` file under `src/` or `tests/` exceeds 600 lines. |\n| R13 | `src/shepherd/web/**` contains none of `innerHTML`, `outerHTML`, `insertAdjacentHTML`, `document.write`, `eval(`, `new Function` (\u00a713, textContent only). |\n| R14 | tmux: in `src/`, `tests/`, `scripts/`, any argv or command that invokes `tmux` must include `-L`. `kill-server` may appear only right after `-L <name>` where name \u2209 {`shepherd`, `default`}. |\nEOF\nwc -l /root/Shepherd/docs/plans/2026-09-13-m1-foundation-visibility-plan.md"}
